second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which competition or event did Frances Marie Burke win?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 106, \"text\": \"**CYPRUS CROWNED: American Model Frances Marie Burke Takes Top Honors at Prestigious Miss Cyprus Pageant**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 108, \"end\": 320, \"text\": \"Nicosia, Cyprus - In a stunning upset, American model Frances Marie Burke was crowned the winner of the coveted Miss Cyprus beauty contest, held at the luxurious Four Seasons Hotel in Nicosia on Saturday evening.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 321, \"end\": 520, \"text\": \"The 25-year-old stunner from New York City edged out 19 other contestants from around the world to claim the coveted title, impressing judges with her poise, elegance, and captivating stage presence.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 521, \"end\": 666, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm completely overwhelmed and humbled by this incredible honor,\\\" Burke said in an exclusive interview with our publication, beaming with pride.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 667, \"end\": 816, \"text\": \"\\\"Competing against such talented and beautiful women was an experience I'll never forget, and to be chosen as the winner is truly a dream come true.\\\"\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 817, \"end\": 1024, \"text\": \"Burke, who has modeled for top designers and appeared on the covers of numerous fashion magazines, wowed the judges with her stunning looks, impeccable style, and impressive answers to the panel's questions.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1025, \"end\": 1156, \"text\": \"\\\"Frances was a standout from the very beginning,\\\" said Maria Georgiou, a member of the judging panel and renowned fashion designer.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1157, \"end\": 1252, \"text\": \"\\\"Her confidence, charisma, and natural beauty shone through in every aspect of the competition.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1253, \"end\": 1299, \"text\": \"She truly embodies the spirit of Miss Cyprus.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1300, \"end\": 1401, \"text\": \"The competition, now in its 20th year, attracted a record number of applicants from around the globe.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1402, \"end\": 1552, \"text\": \"The contestants were put through a rigorous series of challenges, including a swimsuit round, evening gown segment, and a question-and-answer session.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1553, \"end\": 1711, \"text\": \"According to pageant organizers, this year's event saw a significant increase in viewership, with over 1 million people tuning in to watch the live broadcast.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1712, \"end\": 1870, \"text\": \"\\\"Frances's win is a testament to the growing global appeal of the Miss Cyprus pageant,\\\" said Andreas Christodoulou, president of the Miss Cyprus Organization.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1871, \"end\": 2019, \"text\": \"\\\"We're thrilled to have her as our new ambassador, and we're confident she'll do an outstanding job representing Cyprus on the international stage.\\\"\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2020, \"end\": 2187, \"text\": \"As the new Miss Cyprus, Burke will embark on a year-long reign, during which she will participate in various charity events, fashion shows, and promotional activities.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2188, \"end\": 2266, \"text\": \"She will also represent Cyprus at the upcoming Miss World pageant in December.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2267, \"end\": 2402, \"text\": \"When asked about her plans for her reign, Burke said, \\\"I'm excited to use my platform to make a positive impact on the lives of others.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 72, \"text\": \"Title: The Crowning Glory: Frances Marie Burke's Triumph at Miss America\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 74, \"end\": 272, \"text\": \"It was a chilly winter evening in February 1940 when the lights of the Warner Theatre in Atlantic City, New Jersey, shone bright, illuminating the stage for the 14th annual Miss America competition.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 273, \"end\": 407, \"text\": \"Among the 42 contestants vying for the coveted title was a stunning 20-year-old from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania - Frances Marie Burke.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 408, \"end\": 551, \"text\": \"Little did anyone know that this poised and charming young woman would soon make history, etching her name in the annals of American pageantry.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 552, \"end\": 717, \"text\": \"Frances, a model by profession, had already gained recognition in the fashion world, gracing the covers of prominent magazines and strutting down catwalks with ease.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 718, \"end\": 835, \"text\": \"Her experience in the industry had honed her confidence, and she was determined to bring home the Miss America crown.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 836, \"end\": 1048, \"text\": \"As the competition unfolded, Frances impressed the judges with her striking features, captivating stage presence, and impressive talent - a flawless rendition of the opera song \\\"Caro Nome\\\" from Verdi's Rigoletto.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1049, \"end\": 1219, \"text\": \"Her poise and elegance during the evening gown segment left the audience in awe, and her thoughtful responses to the judges' questions showcased her intelligence and wit.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1220, \"end\": 1270, \"text\": \"On February 10, 1940, the moment of truth arrived.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1271, \"end\": 1375, \"text\": \"The emcee, Bob Russell, announced the top five finalists, and Frances Marie Burke's name was among them.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1376, \"end\": 1461, \"text\": \"The tension was palpable as the judges deliberated, and finally, the results were in.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1462, \"end\": 1537, \"text\": \"With a beaming smile, Bob Russell declared, \\\"And the new Miss America is...\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1538, \"end\": 1559, \"text\": \"Frances Marie Burke!\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1560, \"end\": 1697, \"text\": \"The audience erupted in applause as Frances, resplendent in her evening gown, was crowned by the outgoing titleholder, Patricia Donnelly.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1698, \"end\": 1856, \"text\": \"The Philadelphia Inquirer reported, \\\"Miss Burke's victory was a popular one, and she was mobbed by her fellow contestants and friends after the announcement.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1857, \"end\": 1860, \"text\": \"(1)\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1862, \"end\": 1915, \"text\": \"Frances's triumph was not limited to the stage alone.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1916, \"end\": 2003, \"text\": \"Her win marked a significant milestone in the history of the Miss America organization.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2004, \"end\": 2136, \"text\": \"She was the first contestant from Pennsylvania to claim the title, paving the way for future generations of Keystone State beauties.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2137, \"end\": 2140, \"text\": \"(2)\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2142, \"end\": 2326, \"text\": \"In the aftermath of her victory, Frances embarked on a whirlwind tour, traveling across the United States, and participating in various charity events, parades, and public appearances.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Miss Cyprus\", \"Miss America\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Miss Cyprus\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Miss America\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Miss World\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
